# NOTICE

Completo is a community bundle for DeepSeek Harness. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by DeepSeek. "DeepSeek" and "DeepSeek Harness" are
used here only to say what this bundle plugs into.

## What this repository contains

- `src/`, `scripts/`, `cordis.patch.yml`, `icon.svg` — original work, MIT (see
  `LICENSE`).
- `skills/*/SKILL.md` — original prose by the Completo contributors, MIT.

## Upstream work it builds on

- **DeepSeek Harness** and its `@deepseek-ai/*` packages (the `skills` service,
  `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme`,
  `@deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-office`): the provider shape in
  `src/skills/index.js` follows the shipped `dsh-skill-office` plugin so a
  Completo pack behaves like a bundled one. Those packages keep their own
  licences; Completo ships none of their code.
- **Cordis** (the plugin loader DeepSeek Harness is built on): the
  `apply(ctx, config)` / `inject` plugin contract used throughout.
- **Playwright MCP** (`@playwright/mcp`, Apache-2.0, Microsoft) — referenced,
  not bundled.
- **Chrome DevTools MCP** (`chrome-devtools-mcp`, Apache-2.0, Google) —
  referenced, not bundled.
- **Context7 MCP** (`@upstash/context7-mcp`, MIT, Upstash) — referenced, not
  bundled.
- **GitHub MCP Server** (`ghcr.io/github/github-mcp-server`, MIT, GitHub) —
  referenced, not bundled.
- **Postgres MCP** (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-postgres`, MIT, Anthropic) —
  referenced, not bundled; upstream has not been released since 2024-12.

## Fonts

Completo does not bundle a font. The suggested text stack names Aptos and Segoe
UI, which are Microsoft system fonts that may or may not be installed on your
machine; Completo never redistributes them.
